# ALARM packages hosted in [pocknix-base] but installed by no image (opt-in via
# pacman -S on a locked device). The harvest only sees what a build installed, hence
# a hand list; every dep must be hosted too or snapshot-base.sh refuses. dev/pacman-repo.md

# --- VPN / remote access ---
tailscale
wireguard-tools      # no openresolv for wg-quick DNS: conflicts with the base's systemd-resolvconf
